Insurance Industry Guide: A Beginner's Complete Reference

# Insurance Industry Guide:A Beginner's Complete Reference

*From Core Concepts to Specialist Terminology*

A comprehensive onboarding reference for professionals new to the insurance industry

Prepared August 2026

| Table of Contents 1.  Introduction 2.  How Insurance Works 3.  The Lloyd's of London Market 4.  Syndicates 5.  Managing General Agents (MGAs) 6.  Delegated Underwriting 7.  Bordereaux 8.  Reinsurance 9.  Catastrophe Modeling 10.  Run-Off and RITC (Reinsurance to Close) 11.  Glossary of Key Insurance Terms |
